# The live deploy script is per-server: copy deploy/update.sh.example to
# update.sh on the box and fill in its real paths (see DEPLOY_ORACLE.md
# step 21). Never committed, so a pull can't overwrite a server's paths —
# and so it can't be accidentally staged, which is easy to do and leaves
# the repo sitting in a permanently half-committed state.
/update.sh
/update.sh.bak-*
